      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Labelled field with a violet focus border and pale ring.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-field\"><label class=\"ds-label\" for=\"ds-email\">Correo electrónico</label><input class=\"ds-input\" id=\"ds-email\" placeholder=\"tu@correo.com\"/></div>",
      "css": ".ds-field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; width: 280px; } .ds-label { font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-neutral-700); } .ds-input { border: 1px solid var(--color-neutral-300); border-radius: 16px; background: #fff; color: var(--color-neutral-800); padding: 12px 16px; font-size: 1rem; font-family: inherit; outline: none; transition: border-color 150ms, box-shadow 150ms; } .ds-input::placeholder { color: var(--color-neutral-500); } .ds-input:focus { border-color: var(--color-violet-600); box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--color-violet-100); }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Module Tile",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "module-tile-lg",
      "description": "The signature element: a module's hue and icon, shown here for Profesores and Alumnos.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tiles\"><span class=\"ds-tile-sky\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z\"/><path d=\"M22 10v6\"/><path d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-tile-emerald\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"/><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/></svg></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tiles { display: flex; gap: 12px; } .ds-tile-sky { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1.5px solid var(--color-sky-200); background: var(--color-sky-50); color: var(--color-sky-700); --tile-shadow: var(--color-sky-400); box-shadow: var(--shadow-tile); } .ds-tile-emerald { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1.5px solid var(--color-emerald-200); background: var(--color-emerald-50); color: var(--color-emerald-700); --tile-shadow: var(--color-emerald-400); box-shadow: var(--shadow-tile); }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "The white, very round surface with hairline border and soft shadow.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-card\"><h3 class=\"ds-card-title\">Próximo cobro</h3><p class=\"ds-card-text\">Mensualidad de noviembre, pendiente de pago.</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-card { width: 280px; border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-neutral-200) 80%, transparent); border-radius: 28px; background: #fff; padding: 20px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-surface); } .ds-card-title { margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-neutral-900); } .ds-card-text { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--color-neutral-600); }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sidebar Links",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-link-active",
      "description": "Active link at full strength; inactive tiles muted until hover.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a class=\"ds-nav-link ds-nav-active\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-nav-tile-emerald\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"/><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/></svg></span>Alumnos</a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-nav-tile-sky\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z\"/><path d=\"M22 10v6\"/><path d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"/></svg></span>Profesores</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 240px; } .ds-nav-link { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; border-radius: 17.6px; padding: 6px 12px 6px 6px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-neutral-700); text-decoration: none; transition: background-color 200ms, color 200ms; } .ds-nav-link:hover { background: var(--color-neutral-50); color: var(--color-neutral-900); } .ds-nav-link:focus-visible { outline: none; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #fff, 0 0 0 4px var(--color-violet-600); } .ds-nav-active, .ds-nav-active:hover { background: var(--color-neutral-100); font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-neutral-900); } .ds-nav-tile-sky { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1.5px solid var(--color-sky-200); background: var(--color-sky-50); color: var(--color-sky-700); --tile-shadow: var(--color-sky-400); box-shadow: var(--shadow-tile); } .ds-nav-tile-emerald { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1.5px solid var(--color-emerald-200); background: var(--color-emerald-50); color: var(--color-emerald-700); --tile-shadow: var(--color-emerald-400); box-shadow: var(--shadow-tile); } .ds-nav-link:not(.ds-nav-active) span { opacity: 0.55; transition: opacity 200ms; } .ds-nav-link:hover span { opacity: 1; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Event Chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip",
      "description": "Event type in its module hue, with darker ink for contrast.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-chip-torneo\">Torneo</span>",
      "css": ".ds-chip-torneo { display: inline-block; border: 1px solid var(--color-rose-200); border-radius: 9999px; background: var(--color-rose-50); color: var(--color-rose-800); padding: 4px 12px; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; }"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Color-Coded Dojo",
    "overview": "Every area of the school owns one hue, carried by a tinted icon tile wherever that area appears: the sidebar, the page heading, the shortcuts. People find their place by color first and read second. The rest of the interface stays quiet so those hues can do that work: near-white ground, white surfaces, neutral text, one violet for action.\n\nThe surfaces are very round, hairline-bordered and softly lifted, floating over a faint dot grid. The density suits daily administrative work on a computer and a family checking a balance on a phone, and both get the same care. The system rejects the grey admin template with a single blue accent.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "One hue per module, identical on every screen.",
      "Light only: near-white dotted ground, white surfaces.",
      "One family, Mona Sans, with bold headings and no tracked or uppercase labels.",
      "Very round corners, hairline borders, soft shadows.",
      "Violet is the action color and the focus color."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Module Map Rule",
        "body": "A module's hue means that module and appears the same in the sidebar, the page heading and its shortcuts. A new module gets its own unused hue. A new event type reuses the hue of the module it belongs to.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Literal Meaning Rule",
        "body": "Colors that already mean something outside the app stay literal. A belt badge uses the belt's real color (`BELT_STYLES` in `types/student.ts`) and a class discipline uses its own color (`DISCIPLINE_STYLES` in `types/dojoClass.ts`), even where that hue matches a module.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Violet Action Rule",
        "body": "The primary action on any surface is filled violet. Module hues identify; they do not ask to be clicked.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Light Only Rule",
        "body": "The system is light only (`color-scheme: light`). No dark theme exists, so none of these tokens has a dark counterpart.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Plain Zero Rule",
        "body": "Never set tabular figures on Mona Sans. Its tabular zero is slashed, verified in a render, and that hurts the legibility of money.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Quiet Label Rule",
        "body": "Labels are sentence case at the default letter-spacing. Hierarchy comes from weight and ink.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Soft Offset Rule",
        "body": "Shadows are blurred and drawn in below the element. Hard-edged offset shadows do not belong here.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Nested Corner Rule",
        "body": "An inner shape takes a smaller radius than its container, close to the outer radius minus the padding between them, as in sidebar links around their tiles and the top bar around its buttons.",
        "section": "shapes"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do carry a module's hue through `ModuleTile` wherever that module appears.",
      "Do mute inactive sidebar tiles and keep only the active one at full strength.",
      "Do keep money amounts in proportional Mona Sans figures, with status spelled out in words.",
      "Do pair every status color with its label, and keep chip text at the `chip-*-ink` depth for 4.5:1 contrast.",
      "Do wrap every transition with a reduced-motion opt-out."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't use tabular figures with Mona Sans.",
      "Don't assign a module's hue to a different module or swap it per screen.",
      "Don't recolor belts or class disciplines to fit the module palette.",
      "Don't add dark-theme tokens without an approved system change.",
      "Don't use flashka.ai's logo, name, mascot or illustrations. It is a visual reference only.",
      "Don't tilt module tiles outside the login."
    ]
  }
}
